# Explicit netlist (KiCad unavailable on build host; see README)
NET VBUS_5V  : J2.VBUS U3.IN U4.IN C13.1
NET DVDD     : U4.OUT U1.VDD[1..6] C1..C6.1 J1.1
NET AVDD     : FB1.2 U3.OUT U2.V+ U5.IN U1.VDDA C7..C10.1 C14.1
NET VREF     : U5.OUT U1.VREFP C11.1
NET GND      : (single plane; AGND/DGND joined at U1 VSSA via FB1 region)
NET LED_IR_EN  : U1.P0_19(SCT0_OUT) Q1.G
NET LED_RED_EN : U1.P0_22(SCT0_OUT) Q2.G
NET LED_IR_K   : D1.K Q1.D ; Q1.S RS1.1 ; RS1.2 GND
NET LED_RED_K  : D2.K Q2.D ; Q2.S RS2.1
NET LED_A      : D1.A D2.A VBUS_5V
NET PD1_IN   : PD1.K U2.INA- RF1.1 CF1.1   (PD1.A -> GND, photovoltaic mode)
NET PPG1     : U2.OUTA RF1.2 CF1.2 U1.ADC0_CH0
NET PD2_IN   : PD2.K U2.INB- RF2.1 CF2.1
NET PPG2     : U2.OUTB RF2.2 CF2.2 U1.ADC0_CH1
NET VBIAS    : U2.INA+ U2.INB+ (AVDD/10 divider, 0.33V)
NET SWD      : J1.SWDIO U1.SWDIO ; J1.SWCLK U1.SWCLK ; J1.RESET U1.RESETN
NET USB      : J2.DP U1.USB0_DP ; J2.DM U1.USB0_DM
